PhoneBox 0.6.9 — panel: every page is its own compositor layer.
Why: during the 0001 settle the pager has overflow-x: hidden; Chromium does not composite a scroller the user cannot scroll, so every
settle frame repainted and re-rastered the visible strip on the main thread / GPU. In Android WebView GPU raster runs inside the
RenderThread draw functor -> 'Slow issue draw commands' on the phone.
- .page { will-change: transform }. Settle logic unchanged.
Measured (Chromium 1234, GPU raster via SwiftShader, 873x393 @2.75, CPU x6, 8 swipes x 3 runs, median per swipe):
raster tasks 69.6 -> 25 (upstream 40.4) · GPU thread 219 -> 134 ms (upstream 139) · page misses 0.

